      "id": "structure",
      "status": "source-backed",
      "interpretation": "Package and system boundary; reusable types and owned versus external part roles. Definition names are derived from the explicit role/type names.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source": "S1",
          "startLine": 2,
          "endLine": 2,
          "quote": "Create a SysML v2 model of a cooler system using package CoolerStudy. The system context contains cooler:Cooler and an external operator:Operator. Cooler owns probe:Probe and controller:Controller. Probe provides temperature observations to controller; controller sends cooling commands to an actuator:Actuator, also owned by Cooler. Operator provides an enable command to the Cooler boundary; the boundary forwards that same command to controller. Use these exact role/type names for traceability."
        }
      ],
